{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A branching narrative, visual novel dating sim where you play asteroid dT. There are 4 loves, astronomical secrets, and multiple endings based on your choices. Eject mass to change your orbit and meet different planets, but lose too much and you risk breaking apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Alien Fork\u00a0Discord to share origin story theories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986020/extras/5ddb8bc44c15f095d4dee5a45f3015da.avif?t=1764954672\" width=400 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dT was born in Ananke System where we begin. You\u2019ll find yourself tangled in a forbidden orbit \u2014 an enemies-to-lovers connection that it seems can only end in heartbreak. But beyond tragedy lies the promise of something greater: Thallo System, our own solar system, where three new romances await. Will you risk leaving everything behind to seek them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986020/extras/bc9bb84510409d565fcc01f4c11901ac.avif?t=1764954672\" width=400 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In <i>Jupiter\u2019s Orbit</i>, choices matter.</strong> Every dialogue, every path, every orbit changes dT's fate and the heart of your journey. Some routes will end in sorrow. Others may unlock hidden chances at love, even where hope seemed lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude90 Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A romantasy visual novel where asteroids and planets are friends, enemies, or potential lovers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching storylines with multiple routes, endings, and hidden paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 love interests: Tragic first loves in Ananke System, followed by three new romances if you make it to Thallo System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional storytelling, rich character dynamics, and the freedom to choose love\u2026 or drift away</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Jupiter's Orbit is a choice-driven romantasy visual novel/dating sim.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Love in Fall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3986020/79bca14747da4357c72f2755241bb69464773750.jpg"},{"name":"Disintegrating Love","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3986020/61b4f85ac45e3b1fa50e2110f9a87223bb892ae5.jpg"},{"name":"Black Hole Suicide","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3986020/4b52016dc0dca8f1c4d617e9ad6e274a4cda278e.jpg"},{"name":"Quiet, Home","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3986020/b374f3a3452a4dd3d39b588171ec369f3cc56034.jpg"},{"name":"The Belt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3986020/b6fbcdb05c5cec7da0bb924f0e5d7409ac9fd42e.jpg"},{"name":"Silent Moon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3986020/43a3e0c80cf729d20b48098634aa7f4d2881192d.jpg"},{"name":"Prisoner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3986020/429b162926544c12f88a11576f400ca81ad35979.jpg"},{"name":"Complete The Void","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3986020/bb5f049c5f8b98cc94e89a762220490b3739bb88.jpg"},{"name":"Return to You","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3986020/da9200f1f5b809190bf4fb1c9d98b951ed32699c.jpg"},{"name":"Absolute Fall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3986020/ee210a60c183f68227b326fcedddb830af632829.jpg"}],"total":36},"backgr